# 4. Authentication vs Authorization

Two different concepts:

## Authentication

Answers:

"Who are you?"

Example:

```text
User → IAM Identity
```

---

## Authorization

Answers:

"What can you do?"

Example:

```text
User

Can:

✔ View Pods

✘ Delete Nodes
```

