# 37. Common EKS Security Mistakes

## Mistake 1

Running containers as root.

Solution:

```text
Use non-root users
```

---

## Mistake 2

Giving excessive IAM permissions.

Solution:

```text
Least privilege access
```

---

## Mistake 3

Storing passwords in images.

Solution:

```text
Use Secrets Manager
```

---

## Mistake 4

Allowing all network traffic.

Solution:

```text
Use Network Policies
```

---

## Mistake 5

Using unverified images.

Solution:

```text
Scan images
```

